; Display Hot Keys messages for the ChineseSimplified installer, read after the Inno Setup messages of that language

[CustomMessages]
; Language tag the app reads to show itself in the language picked for setup
AppLanguageTag=zh-CN
RemoveSettingsPrompt=是否同时删除所有用户已保存的 Display Hot Keys 设置？%n%n保留这些设置可在重新安装时保留已保存的槽位。
